Libraries installed by Composer
-------------------------------
They are not part of this repository: "composer install" puts them in
vendor/, each with its licence in its own folder, and a bundle made by
"php nyuRun bundle" carries them as they are.

  level-2/dice              BSD-2-Clause         the dependency injection container
  firebase/php-jwt          BSD-3-Clause         the signed tokens (JWT)
  dompdf/dompdf             LGPL-2.1             PDF documents, written
  dompdf/php-font-lib       LGPL-2.1-or-later    used by dompdf
  dompdf/php-svg-lib        LGPL-3.0-or-later    used by dompdf
  smalot/pdfparser          LGPL-3.0             PDF documents, read
  masterminds/html5         MIT                  used by dompdf
  sabberworm/php-css-parser MIT                  used by dompdf
  symfony/polyfill-mbstring MIT                  used by dompdf

Suggested, installed only when a project asks for it:

  phpmailer/phpmailer       LGPL-2.1-only        mail accounts of type phmail

The libraries under the LGPL are used as they are published, as separate
packages: their source and their licence travel with them, and anyone may
replace them with another version of the same library.


Programs nyuRuns runs, not distributed with it
----------------------------------------------
  ffmpeg                    LGPL or GPL, depending on how it was built:
                            run as a separate program to change sounds
                            (SND_TOOL in conf/system.ini)
  database servers          MySQL, MariaDB, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, SQLite:
                            reached through their PHP extensions


